# Fénix Definition Language (FDL) Example
# Simple Todo Application

product TodoApp

vision
    A modern, cross-platform todo application with real-time sync
    and collaboration features. Supports multiple lists, tags,
    due dates, and team sharing.

users
    User
        Creates and manages todos
        Can share lists with others
        Sets due dates and priorities

    Admin
        Manages user accounts
        Monitors system health

constraints
    MaxLatency: 100ms
        Real-time sync must be fast

    OfflineSupport
        App must work offline with sync on reconnect

    GDPR
        User data deletion on request

feature TaskManagement
    story CreateTodo
        requirement
            User can create a new todo item
            Todo must have a title
            Optional: description, due date, priority, tags
        acceptance
            Given a user wants to add a task
            When they enter a title and save
            Then the todo is created
            And it appears in their list
        architecture
            API
                TodoService
                    Creates todo items
                    Validates input
            Database
                PostgreSQL
                    Stores todos with metadata
        tests
            Unit: Input validation
            Integration: Database persistence

    story CompleteTodo
        requirement
            User can mark todo as completed
            Completed todos move to done section
            User can uncomplete todos
        acceptance
            Given a user has an active todo
            When they mark it as complete
            Then it moves to completed section
            And they can restore it if needed
        architecture
            API
                TodoService
                    Updates todo status
            Database
                PostgreSQL
                    Updates todo records
        tests
            Unit: Status update logic
            Integration: Database update

feature Lists
    story CreateList
        requirement
            User can create multiple todo lists
            Lists can be named and colored
            Default list is created on signup
        acceptance
            Given a user wants to organize tasks
            When they create a new list
            Then the list is created
            And they can add todos to it
        architecture
            API
                ListService
                    Manages todo lists
            Database
                PostgreSQL
                    Stores list metadata
        tests
            Unit: List creation
            Integration: Default list creation

feature Sharing
    story ShareList
        requirement
            User can share list with others
            Sharee can view and edit shared list
            Owner can revoke access
        acceptance
            Given a user wants to collaborate
            When they share a list with email
            Then the recipient gets access
            And they can edit todos
        architecture
            API
                SharingService
                    Manages permissions
                    Handles invitations
            Database
                PostgreSQL
                    Stores sharing relationships
        tests
            Unit: Permission logic
            Integration: Invitation flow

feature Sync
    story RealtimeSync
        requirement
            Changes sync across devices in real-time
            Offline changes sync on reconnect
            Conflict resolution: last write wins
        acceptance
            Given a user has multiple devices
            When they make a change on one device
            Then it appears on other devices
            And offline changes sync when back online
        architecture
            Realtime
                WebSocket
                    Pushes changes to clients
                SyncService
                    Handles conflict resolution
            Database
                PostgreSQL
                    Stores version history
        tests
            Integration: WebSocket sync
            Unit: Conflict resolution

implementation
    Backend
        Language: Go 1.22+
        Framework: Chi router
        Database: PostgreSQL 15
        Realtime: WebSocket

    Frontend
        Framework: React 18
        Meta-framework: Next.js 14
        UI Library: Tailwind CSS
        State Management: Zustand

    Mobile
        Framework: React Native
        State: Redux Toolkit

release
    v1.0
        MVP with core features
        Todo CRUD
        Lists
        Basic sharing
        Web app only
